  1195	  direct SCL load/max-cap severity from a first pass back into the same bounded
  1196	  strong-seed area margin. Stmap37 restricts that SCL feedback to first-pass
  1197	  over-cap hotspot AIG IDs and their immediate mapped fanin cone. Stmap38
  1198	  broadens the first-pass association and checks candidate cut leaves against
  1199	  that hotspot set before applying the local SCL feedback term.]
